# GitHub Actions CI

Workflow: `.github/workflows/playwright.yml` on push/PR to `main`. Jobs: `lint` then `test`.

- `lint`: `npm ci`, `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`
- `test`: `npm ci`, `npx playwright install --with-deps`, `npx playwright test`, upload `playwright-report/`
- Keep `forbidOnly` on CI. Do not skip browsers or ignore failures unless asked.
- Node LTS only. Timeouts go in job `timeout-minutes` or `playwright.config.ts`.
- Secrets: `${{ secrets.NAME }}` only.
